 SUMMARY: both NAMED endpoints of the cycle-rank triangle are FREE-PROBABILITY
 objects of the SAME triangle, dual across the moment<->cumulant divide:
   * diagonal t(k,k)=A088368(k)  = free MOMENTS  (kappa_n = n!,  factorial law)
   * signed row sum (-1)^k C_k   = free CUMULANTS (two-point law, ADD-4)
